{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jIgFamaZ4m1794351828.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>禾賽截至九月底止季度按年少賺六成八，盈利8,080萬元人民幣。經營盈利6,260萬元人民幣，跌一成九。</p><p></p><p>期內淨收入10.68億元人民幣，增長三成四。當中激光雷達分部淨收入增長近兩成三，至9.77億元人民幣。戰略增長業務分部淨收入則達9,050萬元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.240266+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T02:24:05.142518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:25.593601+00:00","content_hash":"659e73e12af3889588c093593742a4aecbfee54ae4e8ddd23ef80883b3069e02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}